<section class="ib-hero"><div class="ib-shell ib-hero__grid"><div class="ib-hero__copy"><p class="ib-kicker">Hair salons and styling studios</p><h1>Turn new service enquiries into <em>booked chairs</em> and returning clients.</h1><p class="ib-lede">Chakusa connects salon enquiries, appointments, client notes, honest reviews, and the next return visit without adding another disconnected admin tool.</p><div class="ib-actions"><a class="ui-button ui-button--primary" href="/get-started">Start free trial <StoryIcon name="arrow_forward" /></a><a class="ui-button ui-button--secondary" href="#salon-workflow">See how Chakusa works</a></div><p class="ib-proof">First 14 days free. Choose the plan that fits your business.</p><dl class="ib-metrics"><div><dt>Enquiries</dt><dd>Captured</dd></div><div><dt>Appointments</dt><dd>Connected</dd></div><div><dt>Clients</dt><dd>Remembered</dd></div></dl></div><div class="ib-scene ib-scene--flat" aria-label="Animated flat illustration of a salon owner using Chakusa"><div class="ib-scene__halo"></div><TradeCharacterAlt class="ib-scene__character" /></div></div></section>
